  "newContractFindings": [
    "Official answer confirms a configurable business-number generation rule; it does not specify the available format tokens, reset scope, duplicate reservation, permissions or cancellation behavior.",
    "Shared request no_001 has its own display-name resolver. Generic inventory_doc_no_fn consults numbering_info.autocode_info.no_001 and suppresses manual generation/check-duplicate functions for Automatic inputmake_type2. Generic payload code40 is not proof of request-specific settings.",
    "Combination resolver loads business mapping and condition information. Series resolver loads repeats by category_sid and returns simple_cd_nm only when one result exists; manual generation API resolver has different behavior outside the selected scope.",
    "CreateNumberingGenProgram requires prop_id/dmc/refer_type, fetches tenant/business numbering entity or sub-business action, clones/normalizes stored script/targets/descriptors and returns false when required configuration is absent.",
    "Missing target values open IEmptyValuePage; cancel/no message returns false. Successful generation writes the selected data model property, with digit/unit logic for multiple records. This does not establish server persistence/reservation/reset semantics."
  ],
